  "solution": {
    "text": "Let,&nbsp;<math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>20</mn><mi>k</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>25</mn><msup><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>15</mn><mi>k</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>66</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>)</mo></math><br /><br />Let the roots of <math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#946;</mi></math><br /><br />Since <math><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#946;</mi></math> are real.<br /><br /><math><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>&#8710;</mo><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>400</mn><msup><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4.4</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>25</mn><msup><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>15</mn><mi>k</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>66</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>15</mn><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>66</mn><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>k</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>22</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br />We have <math><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>2</mn></math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>4</mn></math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>20</mn><mi>k</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>&#945;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>&#946;</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>&#945;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>&#946;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>+</mo></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>+</mo></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>40</mn><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>25</mn><msup><mi>k</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>15</mn><mi>k</mi><